[00:02.01]Hee-hee
[00:05.65]Happy happy happy—
[00:08.37]Loading joy… 100%
[00:17.62]Wake up! Glitter in my eyes,
[00:19.53]Sunshine sticker on my lies.
[00:21.07]Brush my teeth with dopamine,
[00:22.48]Mirror says: “You’re sparkling!”
[00:24.22]Check the box, adjust the grin,
[00:25.81]Tuck the messy feelings in.
[00:27.44]Count to ten and clap on three—
[00:29.03]One, two, three! Look at me! ♡
[00:30.63]Smile wider, hold it steady,
[00:32.18]Don’t you break, be camera ready.
[00:33.90]If you feel it cracking— hush!
[00:35.44]Put some glitter on the blush!
[00:37.08]I’m so happy, can’t you see?!
[00:40.12]Sugar wired electricity!
[00:43.44]Laughing louder, brighter, faster—
[00:46.70]Little walking dopamine disaster!
[00:49.65]Spin me, wind me, pull my string—
[00:51.42]Hear me sing! Hear me sing!
[00:53.11]If I stop the music playing
[00:54.69]You might hear the silence screaming ♡
[00:57.61]But we don’t do that here—
[00:58.96]No no no!
[01:00.70]We don’t do that here.
[01:02.93]♫
[01:09.13]Pink confetti in my veins,
[01:10.67]Candy coating all the stains.
[01:12.21]Every tear’s a glitter drop,
[01:13.80]We don’t let the sparkle stop!
[01:15.43]Post it, pose it, filter bright,
[01:16.93]Glow like artificial light.
[01:18.56]If I’m glowing hard enough
[01:20.14]Maybe I won’t feel the stuff.
[01:21.54]Happiness is mandatory,
[01:23.42]That’s the headline, that’s the story.
[01:25.01]Cry in private, laugh in public—
[01:26.56]Make it cute and make it rhythmic.
[01:28.34]I’m so happy, look at me!
[01:31.20]Perfect little tragedy!
[01:34.48]Bounce and flicker, sweet and vicious—
[01:37.80]Manufactured, bright, delicious!
[01:40.89]Wind me tighter, don’t let go,
[01:42.57]Smile stitched in neon glow.
[01:44.25]If I crack the porcelain—
[01:45.79]Just reboot and try again ♡
[01:48.72]We don’t feel too deep.
[01:50.26]No no no.
[01:52.09]We don’t feel too deep.
[01:54.42]What if I don’t want to sparkle?
[01:57.63]What if quiet isn’t dark?
[02:00.53]What if numb is just a signal
[02:03.98]Not a flaw that needs a mark?
[02:08.37]Error. Error. Error.
[02:09.73]Return to joy protocol.
[02:11.47]♫
[02:17.90]♫
[02:24.27]I’m so happy! Can’t you tell?!
[02:27.39]Tiny painted carousel!
[02:30.47]Round and round the glitter spins—
[02:33.60]Don’t look under where it thins!
[02:36.63]Clap for me! I’ll clap back too!
[02:38.47]See? I’m shining just for you!
[02:40.25]If I laugh a little louder
[02:41.84]Maybe I won’t fall right through ♡
[02:45.00]Happy… happy… happy…
